            "reactions" : [ ],
            "urls" : [ ],
            "text" : "Perfect! I have set up the exchange for your product.\n \nYour reference (RMA) number for this exchange is: N056314781\n \nShortly you'll receive an email for payment and once this is authorized, you'll receive a pre-paid shipping label to your email address. Please ensure you place your product in suitable packaging and then attach the provided label we send.\n \nOnce you have done this, please go to one of the three drop-off points found on the shipping labels, or, contact UPS using the “Schedule a Collection” option on the shipping labels. You can then arrange a collection for a time and location that suits you.\n \nWas there anything else I could help you with today?\n\n-Sam",
