            "reactions" : [ ],
            "urls" : [ ],
            "text" : "We have begun testing Focusrite products with pre-release beta versions of macOS Monterey, but since this is an unreleased OS, we do not provide technical support for any issues you might experience while using a pre-release beta. \n\nWe would recommend using Big Sur until Monterey is officially released.",
