            "reactions" : [ ],
            "urls" : [ ],
            "text" : "We really appreciate resetting your devices and we’re glad they’re working now. Don’t be, we’ll take everything that’s happened as feedback to better our products and pass it along to the right team. If there’s anything else that we can help you with, you know where to find us.",
