            "reactions" : [ ],
            "urls" : [ ],
            "text" : "My last contact with you was on July 11th, and today is August 5th. Almost another month has flown by. I received the machine for the first time in May, and it's been three months of back-and-forth since then. I don't know what's going on with your team. My emails to you have gone unanswered since mid-July.",
