            "reactions" : [ ],
            "urls" : [ ],
            "text" : "We’ve shipped over 8k devices. I’m working on tracking down your order. I’m sorry my wife was admitted to the hospital and I’ve been trying to deal with that.  You’ve got to understand this team is comprised of 4 people. We’re working as hard as we can.",
