            "text" : "Hi Leask, we’re excited to share the news that the 9th Snapmaking Contest has started. This time we encourage our users to make anything related to plants! It could be gardening accessories or simply works that feature flowers and greenery. You can enter the contest through Twitter/Facebook/Instagram or directly upload your project to the Contest Gallery.  \n\nIf you are interested in it, you can learn about the prizes and rules here: https://t.co/kJG8jm34D7……. Look forward to your participation and have a nice day!",
