            "text" : "Hi Sixia \"Leask\" Huang,\n\nI’m working on Clacky AI, a coding agent that doesn’t just edit like Cursor or Lovable, but helps you plan, build and evolve full projects. \n\nI believe a serious coding agent will be a better tool for you. I’d love to humbly hear your thoughts — would you be open to giving feedback as an early user?\n\nLet me know if you have any feedback: https://t.co/DB3GBDPCng\n\nReally appreciate that. \n\nCheers!\nIvan, Head of Product at Clacky AI",
